### "Self reference is not supported when updating the value of variable"

**Where it appears:** `Set variable — REPORT_DATE` step

**Cause:** The variable's value field is referencing the variable itself (REPORT_DATE) instead of the Parse JSON output (Body REPORT_DATE).

**Fix:** In the Set variable step, clear the Value field and re-add it from dynamic content. Under the **Parse JSON** section (not the Variables section), select **Body REPORT_DATE**.

